---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – roammate – travel companion app" description="How roammate protects your data, location privacy, and personal information. Read our privacy commitments for the travel companion app." ogImage="/images/rm-full.svg">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="section-label section-label--center">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: February 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="content-box reveal">
      <p>At roammate, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application and services.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information that you provide directly to us, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Account information (name, email address, profile photo)</li>
        <li>Location data when you use location-based features</li>
        <li>Travel plans and itineraries you create or join</li>
        <li>Messages and communications with other users</li>
        <li>Device information and usage data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our services</li>
        <li>Connect you with other travelers based on your preferences and location</li>
        <li>Send you notifications about travel plans and messages</li>
        <li>Ensure the safety and security of our platform</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We may share your information in the following circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With other users as part of the core functionality of connecting travelers</li>
        <li>With service providers who assist in operating our platform</li>
        <li>When required by law or to protect our rights</li>
        <li>In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access and receive a copy of your personal data</li>
        <li>Rectify inaccurate personal data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal data</li>
        <li>Object to or restrict processing of your data</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Location Data</h2>
      <p>roammate uses location data to connect you with nearby travelers and enhance your experience. You can control location permissions through your device settings. Disabling location services may limit certain features of the app.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Our app may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third parties. We encourage you to read their privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>roammate is not intended for users under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at privacy@roammate.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 160px 40px 80px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .page-hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(196, 86, 42, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .page-hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .section-label--center {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-label--center::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .page-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .page-content {
    padding: 0 40px 160px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content-box h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin: 40px 0 16px;
  }

  .content-box p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .content-box ul {
    margin: 0 0 16px 24px;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .content-box li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 140px 24px 60px; }
    .page-content { padding: 0 24px 100px; }
  }
</style>
